      (1) head and tail are both None or both Some
      (2) if head = Some h and tail = Some t:
        (2a) t is reachable from h by next pointers
        (2b) t.next = None
        (2c) h is reachable from t by prev pointers
        (2d) h.prev = None
        (2e) for every node n, if n.next = Some m then m.prev = Some n
        (2f) for every node n, if n.prev = Some m then m.next = Some n *)

